<style>
body{font:16px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:60rem;margin:0 auto;padding:1rem;color:#1a1a1a;background:#fff}
code{background:#f2f2f2;padding:0 .2em;word-break:break-all}
table{border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0}th,td{border:1px solid #767676;padding:.25rem .5rem;text-align:left}
.disclaimer{border:2px solid #1a1a1a;padding:.5rem 1rem;font-weight:600}
a{color:#0b57d0}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>A11yGate evidence pack</h1>
<p class="disclaimer">Automated testing only. Not a WCAG audit, certification or legal advice.</p>
<h2>Scope scanned</h2>
<ul>
<li>Start URL: <code>https://site.test/</code></li>
<li>Origin: <code>https://site.test</code></li>
<li>Scanned at (UTC): 2026-11-12T08:00:00.000Z</li>
<li>Commit: unavailable (not recorded; none was invented)</li>
<li>Pages analysed: 2; failed: 0; links not followed: 0; crawl cap: 2</li>
<li>robots.txt: robots.txt returned HTTP 404; no rules applied.</li>
<li>Engines and rule sets: axe 4.14.0 — axe-core rules filtered by tags [wcag2a, wcag2aa, wcag21a, wcag21aa, wcag22a, wcag22aa, best-practice]</li>
</ul>
<table><caption>Pages</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Page</th><th scope="col">HTTP</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Findings</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>https://site.test/</code></td><td>200</td><td>complete</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td><code>https://site.test/about</code></td><td>200</td><td>complete</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Automated result</h2>
<p>Verdict: <strong>PASS</strong> (fail on: none). Reporting only (--fail-on none).</p>
<table><caption>Findings by severity</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Severity</th><th scope="col">Findings</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">critical</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">serious</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">moderate</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">minor</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">unknown</th><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>Full findings: <a href="scan/a11ygate-scan.html">detailed scan report (HTML)</a> and <code>scan/a11ygate-scan.md</code>.</p>
<h2>What automated testing cannot cover</h2>
<p>This pack records what automated rules detected on the pages listed above. It does not assess:</p>
<ul><li>Most WCAG success criteria need human judgement. Automated rules detect only a subset of accessibility barriers, so an empty findings list is not evidence of conformance.</li><li>Whether text alternatives, form labels, headings, link text and page titles are accurate and meaningful. Tools can only check that they exist.</li><li>Keyboard operability across complete user journeys, logical focus order, visible focus in context and keyboard traps that appear after interaction.</li><li>The experience with screen readers, magnifiers, voice control and other assistive technology.</li><li>Content behind login, forms, multi-step flows, error states, menus, dialogs and other states that a read-only page load does not trigger.</li><li>Pages that were not reached: not linked through same-origin a[href] links, beyond the crawl cap, disallowed by robots.txt, or failed to load.</li><li>Captions, transcripts and audio description for time-based media, and whether they are correct.</li><li>Cognitive and learning accessibility: plain language, consistent navigation, timing, and error prevention and recovery.</li><li>Reflow, zoom, orientation and user style or contrast settings beyond what individual rules check.</li><li>Documents (PDF, office files), native apps, emails and third-party services that were not rendered in the scanned pages.</li></ul>
<p>Manual testing by people, including people with disabilities and assistive technology users, is needed for these areas.</p>
<h2>Scope boundaries</h2>
<ul><li>Only scan sites you own or are explicitly authorized to test.</li><li>Automated testing only: axe-core detects a subset of WCAG issues. Absence of findings is not conformance, certification or legal advice.</li><li>Read-only: pages were loaded without logging in, filling forms or clicking. Authenticated areas, interactions and dynamic states are unassessed.</li><li>Only same-origin pages reachable through a[href] links (at most 20) were visited; robots.txt Disallow rules were honoured.</li></ul>
<h2>Contents of this pack</h2>
<ul><li><code>report.md</code></li><li><code>report.html</code></li><li><code>engines/axe.json</code></li><li><code>scan/a11ygate-scan.html</code></li><li><code>scan/a11ygate-scan.json</code></li><li><code>scan/a11ygate-scan.junit.xml</code></li><li><code>scan/a11ygate-scan.md</code></li><li><code>scan/a11ygate-scan.sarif</code></li><li><code>screenshots/home.png</code></li><li><code>manifest.json</code> — versions, commit, UTC timestamps and the SHA-256 of every other file</li></ul>
<p>Automated testing only. Not a WCAG audit, certification or legal advice.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
"
